{
  "_doc": [
    "Per-source unit specs for troop_units. Wages and battle ratings are",
    "extracted from daw_campaigns_troop_tables_summary.xml §troop_tables.",
    "size_per_unit follows DaW unit conventions: companies of 120 infantry,",
    "squadrons of 60 cavalry, smaller specialist units.",
    "Total monthly cost per unit = (wage_gp_per_soldier + specialist_gp_per_soldier",
    "+ 4 × weekly_supply_gp_per_soldier) × size_per_unit per",
    "§unit_characteristics_summary. weekly_supply_gp_per_soldier is set to 1gp",
    "as a v1 default; specialists default to 0 (mercenary officers are hired",
    "separately). Veteran-tier wages add +12gp/month/soldier per",
    "daw_armies_recruitment.xml §veterans (human only — elven/dwarven mercs",
    "are inherently veteran-equivalent).",
    "race='human' is the default; race-specific entries (dwarven, elven) carry",
    "their own wage from the dwarven/elven sub-tables.",
    "battle_rating is *per soldier* not per unit; the unit's BR is",
    "battle_rating × count, computed at hire and refreshed on casualties."
  ],
